<view class="safe-page"><top-header title="站点详情" subtitle="这一站怎么玩" showBack="{{true}}"/><view class="page-content"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="empty">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="{{station}}"><view class="hero"><view class="dot">{{index+1}}</view><view><view class="name">{{station.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{station.persona}}</view></view></view><view class="panel"><view class="label">环线规则</view><view>随到随上 · 随站下车</view><view class="label">候车建议</view><view>出发前请在实时页确认公交数据状态</view></view><view class="panel"><view>公交站点定位</view><view wx:if="{{transitError}}">{{transitError}}</view><view wx:for="{{stops}}" wx:key="code">{{item.name}}<button wx:if="{{item.canNavigate}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="nav">导航到公交站</button></view><view wx:if="{{!stops.length}}">暂无已匹配的公交站点，不以旅游节点坐标替代。</view></view><view class="section-title"><view class="title">这一站怎么玩</view></view><poi-card wx:for="{{pois}}" wx:key="id" poi="{{item}}"/><view wx:if="{{!pois.length}}" class="empty">这一站暂无已发布地点内容。</view><view class="primary-btn" bindtap="live">查看实时车辆</view></block></view><bottom-nav active="home"/></view>
